msgid ":doc:`payments` for quotes, limits and settlement."
msgstr ":doc:`payments`：报价、限额与结算。"

#: ../../topics/capabilities.rst:415
msgid ":doc:`modules` for the ``service`` module."
msgstr ":doc:`modules`：``service`` 模块。"

